\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Time-Series of Regional Luminosity (1992--2024). Addis Ababa is plotted on the primary Y-axis, showing high volatility and growth, while the other 12 regions are plotted on a secondary or lower-scaled axis to show their relative stagnation. The stark disparity between Addis Ababa and the rest drives the extreme Cook’s Distance values reported in Table~4.}}{2}{}\protected@file@percent }
