\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Regional luminosity inequality in Ethiopia, 1992--2024. The Gini coefficient summarizes the distribution of nighttime lights across regions, showing a decline in inequality through 2018 and a partial rebound by 2024. This trend contextualizes the empirical analysis of favoritism and highlights the evolving spatial concentration of economic activity.}}{3}{}\protected@file@percent }
